Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All over Ethiopia, when people\Nwant sparkling water, they
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.68,0:00:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,simply ask for Ambo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.40,0:00:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But Ambo is not a bottle. It\Nis a town, a few hours west of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.21,0:00:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Addis Ababa. This is the road\Nthere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.27,0:00:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The minibus leaves before\Nsunrise, and the city falls
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.37,0:00:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,away behind the eucalyptus\Ntrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.27,0:00:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The land opens up. Farmers are\Nalready in their fields, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.68,0:00:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,the hills fold into more\Nhills.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.27,0:00:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Every bend in the road brings\Nthe mountains a little closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.27,0:00:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the town appears. Quiet\Nstreets, students walking to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.59,0:00:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,class, the smell of rain on\Nred earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.23,0:00:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Under Ambo, the ground is\Nwarm. Water rises from deep
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.77,0:00:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,below, full of bubbles: the\Nsame water the whole country
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.51,0:00:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.23,0:01:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I drink it here, at the\Nsource. It tastes the same,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.27,0:01:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and completely different.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.23,0:01:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So the next time you order an\NAmbo, remember: it is not just
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.37,0:01:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,water. It is a place.
